WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.780
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.410
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.910
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.720
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.390
by ridding you...

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.560
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.150
At sunset,

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:10.000
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:15.720
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.140
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.430
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.930
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:35.740
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.070
My beloved Mama is an
Aoki-award winning novelist.

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:43.410
Sagami Rei-kun. He's my chauffeur,
manager, and former boyfriend.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:44.700
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.370
I'm Babbit!

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.040
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy,
and good friend.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.920
Mariko-chan, my birth mother's daughter.
In other words, my younger sister.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.510
"Clear, With Occasional Gone Missing"

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.430
The time limit is getting close! Charge!

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.440
Sana-chan, we've been done in!
It's up to you, now!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.570
Leave it to me! Come on,
come on, what are you aiming at!?

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.450
How's that!? How's that!? How's that!?
Am I hitting anything!?

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.450
I'm hitting something, right!?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.120
How'd I do?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.790
You hit Babbit, too.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:25.790
Perfect.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.250
That's far enough!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.120
When did he get back there?

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.750
I've been waiting for you to
let your guard down, Sana-chan.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:35.090
You underhanded,
cowardly, cheating masher!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.170
You're open! Uchiyamada-kun!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.430
Now for a quick verse.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.430
"See a weakness in others,
mend the weakness in yourself.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.100
"Become proficient
in the things you enjoy.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.770
"If you like, like, like me, kiss me!"

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.430
--Yahoo! I nailed it! I won!
--You've stopped making sense.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.440
You can win like this?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.110
"This has been the
'Child's Toy' Virtual Game Special"

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.850
Yes, this has been a taping

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.150
of "Child's Toy."

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:59.110
Kurata Sana. I've got an
accuracy percentage of 95%.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:01.110
I've got 0.3%.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.450
That's pretty lousy.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.790
We Orange Teamers clobbered you!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:10.460
Wow, Sana-chan, you're really good.
You must come here to play a lawt, huh?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.460
I'm so busy with work
that I don't come at all.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:15.460
Shua, shua, I bet you come here
with your boyfriend.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.130
Yuck! I don't even have a boyfriend!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.130
Then again, I did go to
the amusement park before...

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.470
I knew it!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.800
Hey, everyone, this is a big announcement!
We're gonna find out who she's seeing!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.470
No, it's not like that! I went together
with a little girl named Mariko-chan!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.140
What? A goil?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.060
My very cute little sister!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.730
Huh? Sistuh? But Sana-chan,
you're an only child, right? Right?

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.400
No! I mean she's cute,
like she was my little sister!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.410
This is an anime, so it's okay
and awl, but this would be pretty hawsh!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.070
Mariko-chan, how are you?
The amusement park sure was fun, huh?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.410
Let's get together and have
some fun again sometime.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.410
--Don't use the show
for your own poiposes!
--Sana-chan,

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.370
are you sure it was okay
for you to say that?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.080
At the time, you promised
never to see them again, right?

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.750
No problem, no problem.
Mariko-chan sure is cute, though, huh?

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.760
Sana...

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.430
S- Sensei! I'm sure Sana-chan
didn't mean any harm when she said it!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.430
That game...

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.100
I want to try it!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.220
Don't you!? Don't you!?
Next time, let's go do it together!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.100
Can we go tomorrow!?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.770
Oh, I can't, I'll be on location.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.440
--It doesn't hurt
--Well, anyhow,

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.350
--if you get hit by those rays.
--so long as nothing happens, right?

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.770
--But Uchiyamada-kun's
free fall is awfully painful.
--so long as nothing happens, right?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.150
--Zenjiro-sensei sure did look hurt.
--At the time,

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.400
--That was for real.
--nobody imagined that
Sana-chan's jokingly delivered line

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.450
would later develop into a big incident.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.110
Babbit, tap-tap!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.780
Let's get together and have
some fun again sometime.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.450
Don't use the show
for your own poiposes!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.120
Mama, are you watching?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.790
--Yay! Yay! Yay!
--Go to commoicial!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:35.750
Mama! Mama! Sana-chan--
Sana-chan talked to Mawiko!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.420
Were you watching "Child's Toy"?

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.550
Mm-hmm! Know what?
Know what? Know what?

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.590
She said we could go away together!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.090
Really? That's terrific.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.760
Mawiko wants to see Sana-chan!
I wanna see her!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.720
Sure you do. But Sana-chan
is so busy, you know.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.100
I'm going to the amusement park
with Sana-chan!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.440
Please, don't make trouble for Mama.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.060
Keiko-san...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.070
Yes?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.110
I'm all right here, and poor
Mariko shouldn't be all alone.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.070
Okay. Are you done watching TV?
How about we go take a bath?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.450
What about Sana-chan?

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.120
Sana-chan is just inside the TV,
you see...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.120
But we've met her before, huh?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.790
The introductions have gotten put off,
but this is Mariko-chan's papa.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.090
He doesn't seem to say very much.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.800
"The next day,
'Child's Toy' was on location, too"

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.090
Back up, back up!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.140
These morning location shoots
are really tough.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.390
All right, let's go all-out today!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.730
Great! That's the spirit!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:43.230
--Peace! Peace! Kisses! Kisses!
--She's a born cutup.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.070
Hey!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:54.750
Sorry, but where did you put that
one dark green blouse with the stain?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.410
I'll be right there.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.420
Papa is calling. How about
we go back inside?

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.750
No, Mawiko is still pwaying.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:05.420
But can you stay here
and play by yourself?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.420
Mm-hmm!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.840
Okay, I'll be right back.
Stay here, okay?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:15.430
Sorry, but I didn't see it
among the laundry on the shelves.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.100
Right, I know.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.770
Will Mariko be all right?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.770
Yeah...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:25.190
The blouse with the stain, right?
Just a moment, please.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.110
Sana-chan... Sana-chan...

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.450
Is it really Sana-chan!?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.450
Mm-hmm! It's really her!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.030
I heard that "Child's Toy"
is on location!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.040
I want to see her! I want to see her!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.040
Say, is Zenjiro going to be there, too?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.370
I don't really want to see him.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.870
Sana-chan! Yay!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.380
Chance!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.640
Game, set!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.400
I can't see Sana-chan...

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.740
So, Sana-chan will be
traveling by the location bus?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.030
Yeah. If she goes in Sagami-san's car,

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.080
they won't be in time for the makeup
and stuff for her next job.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.990
They're going to
take care of it on the bus.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:23.420
You got beat up again, huh?
Zenjiro-chan, you're pretty lousy.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.420
Sane-yan, where am I!?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:29.090
Zenjiro-chan, while you were knocked out,
everyone else was eating lunch.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:33.050
Lunch? Is that right? Where's my lunch?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.470
It's waiting for you in the bus.
Fried mackerel sandwiches.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.230
Aw, this really isn't my lucky day.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.730
I get the feeling that
nuttin' is going right today.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:46.070
Where's my lunch? He said there'd
be fried mackerel sandwiches.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.950
Is this awl!? There's hawdly
anything left at awl!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.040
Who are you!?

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.250
Don't eat that! That's my lunch!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:08.050
You wanna go at it!? I'll show you
no moicy, even if you are a kid!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.760
Don't cry! Don't cry! Big Brothuh
was wrong! Eat! Eat it awl up!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.770
Mawiko was hungwy.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.110
Your name is Mariko-chan, huh?
Are you one of the kids on "Child's Toy"?

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.440
I've nevuh seen you.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.780
Where's your mama?

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.490
Mama is...

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:37.490
W- w- wait, wait, wait!
Cola! Cola! Cola!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.540
What's so funny, you brat!?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.710
Whoa, don't cry, don't cry, don't cry!

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.710
Big Brothuh has a funny face, huh?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:56.050
Zenjiro-chan, they need
to re-shoot one out. Hurry.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.640
What? A retake?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.390
This week's Sana-chan.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.730
Mariko!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.400
Mariko-chan!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.400
She's not here?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.400
No.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.400
I told her not to move.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:15.740
Not to worry. She has to be close by.
Let's just look for her.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.410
Right.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.080
--Mariko!
--Mariko-chan!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:21.950
"Unworried by her parents' concern..."

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:31.090
♪ When my friends invite me by,
suddenly, he's there! ♪

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.340
--What's the matter, Zenjiro-sensei!?
You're not being much fun!
--Leave me alone.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.050
Mariko!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.720
Really, where could
she have gone off to?

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.060
Do you have any ideas
where she would go?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.390
Any idea where...?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.060
It couldn't be...

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.730
Back up, back up.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.190
It's dangerous here.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.780
Mama...?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.740
Sana-chan!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.410
She's not here!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.290
Sana-chan, where are you?

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.040
Sana-chan!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.590
All you good boys and girls,
whenever you ride in a car,

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:18.090
make sure to fasten your seatbelts.
Promise me!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.090
This is an anime, so it's okay and awl,

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.260
but in real life,
this would be pretty hawsh!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.100
Hey, stawp! No! Don't do that!
Hands off! Hey!

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.060
Ah, star in trouble!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.690
--Zenjiro-chan, you can't go home yet.
You still have that burglar scene.
--Oh, it's Zenjiro.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.980
Ah, that's a drag.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.700
Telephone? Who from?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:47.290
Um, it's... a woman who says her
name is Sakai, so it's probably...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.880
Sakai?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.260
It's coming out, I tell you,
it's coming out, I tell you,
coming out, out!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.560
I'm sorry, I never intended
to call you again,

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:14.570
but Mariko has disappeared. She said
she wanted to see Sana-chan again.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.570
Understood. I will contact Sana.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.240
Sensei...

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.910
Shimura-san, the item.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.580
T- the item?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.250
The wonderful item that I purchased
for just this sort of occasion.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.250
Yes, Sana-chan is right
in the middle of shooting now.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.250
Understood. As soon as Sana-chan
is finished, I'll tell her.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.250
How could Mariko-chan be missing?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.590
Rei-kun, behind you, behind you!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.920
--Over there!
--This is terrible.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.590
This is why dramas are so tense!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.260
Sana-chan?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:50.600
Gorilla! Gorilla! Gorilla!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.940
Mariko-chan!?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.270
They said she was talking
about wanting to see Sana-chan.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:58.530
Today's location shoot
was near where Mariko lives.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.950
It's possible that she
came by to watch on her own.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.280
We have to look for her!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.610
Look! Look! Look!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.280
Now, calm down!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.280
I'm having some guys
on my old route look for her.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.620
Rei-kun's route?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:12.960
"Rei-kun's route" means Rei-kun's
old friends, the homeless network.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.290
That's our Rei-kun for you!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.300
...which means you can rest easy,
Sana-chan, and continue shooting.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.300
But I've got this feeling like
I shouldn't be doing this.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:25.970
I know! I'll have Hayama help!
He knows what Mariko-chan looks like!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.300
Burutcha code!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.310
"Mariko-chan's whereabouts unknown.
Please look for her."

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.560
There! How 'bout that!?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.560
Akito-kun, that was
an amazing combo attack!

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.560
Where did you learn that technique?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.690
I- it's no technique.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:44.570
Ah, it's your Burutcha. Is Sana-chan
trying to contact you? A code?

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.030
It's long.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:46.910
"Burutcha Cryptology for
Former Boss Monkeys
Kurata Sana, Editor in Chief"

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.240
Let's see...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.910
Deciphering the code
is going to be hard.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.580
"Zenjiro-san"

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.580
I'm done, right? I'm done, right?
No more woik today?

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.580
You're good.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:58.920
I'm really going home, now!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.250
Fine, you can go home.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.260
I really am worn out for today!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.930
Fine, go home. Take it easy.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:08.600
You don't have any other work for a while.
See? Your schedule is wide open.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.930
That's kinda sad, too, huh?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.390
"Zenjiro-san"

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.600
Nuttin' good evuh happens to me...

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.600
Out of the way! Out of the way! Out of
the way! Zenjiro-san! I'm in a hurry!

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.690
Are you all right, Zenjiro-san!?

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.360
Aw, that was rough!
Today has really worn me out!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.290
M- my Vursacci suit!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.580
Mister!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.580
What did you do, you brat!?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.250
Ah! You're that kid from before,
aren't you!?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.920
Thief! Thief!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.290
Thief!? H- hush, you dummy!
Where are your parents!?

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.250
I'm going to call them
and have them reimboise me for this!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.920
Mister!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.260
Sane-yan, are you in here!?

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.930
Go find this kid's parents!

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:48.930
Huh?

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.260
This kid's?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.260
W- where did she go?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:56.230
You want me to look for this
kid's parents? Yeah? Yeah? Yeah?

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.940
I ordered away for this remote controlled
lost child search balloon

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.280
for a day like today.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.280
The day when it comes in handy is here!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:10.620
Is this the image from the
camera eye attached to the balloon?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.620
S- Sensei! There's a tiger!
There's a tiger on the screen!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.950
Tiger?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.410
"My Anything-Goes Cooking to Boast About"

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.410
My Anything-Goes Cooking!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.960
Today, we have the always-cheerful
Kurata Sana-chan, from "Child's Toy."

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.960
She's going to show us her
"Okay Anytime, Very Much Japan Rice."

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.960
What is it like?

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.970
It's simple to make! It's the perfect
easy meal for those of you who say

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.970
"I'm just a little bit hungry!"

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.140
And now, the day has come

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.890
when the ingredients include a search
for someone who is missing!

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.560
Here are the ingredients.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:36.890
First comes rice!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:41.020
"Cooking advisor--
Sakurai Hiroaki-sensei"

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:37.560
First comes rice!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.230
A little more than halfway full is good.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.230
Fish sausage!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.230
I hear there's DHA and calcium in there!

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.570
Sour plums! Little ones!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.240
Sour! Sour!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:47.900
Tea!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.910
Babbit likes it strong!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:52.570
Put the rice in a bowl,
and press the sausage into it.

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:55.580
Peel the sausage skin,
and out it into five or six pieces.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.580
Don't put it in as-is.
Did you know that?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.160
Push the sour plums in, too.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.580
If you don't look when you put them in,
it makes it fun to search for them later.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.920
You can use pickled radish
instead of sour plums, too!

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.260
I have to look for her!
If we don't find her soon...!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.260
You're working.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.590
Pour in the tea!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.590
Pour plenty in there!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.590
All done!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.260
If you have too much rice,
add more tea while you're eating.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.930
You can make it quicker
than you'd might expect.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.930
Let's have some!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.270
It's nice and light, and delicious.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.600
You get just a hint of the sour plums
mixed in with the tea and rice flavors.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.440
The main ingredient is the sausage!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.280
I call this "Sausage-Gone-Missing
& Sour-Plum-Search Tea Over Rice."

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.280
Thank you much!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.570
Excuse me, I have to leave early
to look for someone.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:35.870
There's still time!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.240
Shall we have seconds?

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.910
How about the sausage & radish version?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:40.910
Good work, everyone!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.210
Mariko-chan! Mariko-chan,
I'm coming to find you right now!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.500
Sana-chan!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:47.550
Sana-chan...

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.550
Keiko-san!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.220
My husband, Mariko's father.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.220
Sakai. Nice to meet you.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.890
Nice to meet you. Kurata Sana, age 11.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.560
Um, have you found Mariko-chan yet?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.520
Well, you see... for some reason,
ever since yesterday,

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.230
she's been saying she
was going to see Sana-chan,

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.900
and that Sana-chan had said
"let's play together."

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.270
Let's have some fun together again.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.940
This is all because I spoke to
Mariko-chan during yesterday's program.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.950
I'm the one to blame.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.700
No, it's my fault.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.950
I left Mariko all alone,
and went back inside the house.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:21.620
No, it's my fault. I'm the one
who called you in, Keiko-san.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.620
No, it's me!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.620
It's me.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.250
It was me!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.290
Me!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.340
Um, excuse me for interrupting,

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:33.220
but someone on staff said that they
saw a girl that looks like Mariko-chan.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.550
They said that she was following
Sana-chan into the TV station.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.220
I knew it.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.230
Let's look for her! Mariko-chan
must be inside the station!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.890
Out of the way! Out of the way!

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:43.890
Um...

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:47.900
I'm begging you. Right now,
Sana-chan, you're our only hope!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:53.740
Mariko... Mariko is my--
and Keiko-san's-- cherished daughter.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.790
It's all right! We're sure
to find her right away!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.910
Just leave the TV station to me!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.910
Hey, sir, come on!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.920
Whaddya know? Looks like
Sana-chan is busy, too.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.590
Huh? Zenjiro-san,
what's with the outfit?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.920
It's a wine mountain and
toothpick design! Now leave me alone!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.260
Mister!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.930
Right, I had to send
my car into the shawp.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:17.930
I wonduh if the rental is here...

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:22.890
"Zenjiro-sama, this is your rental car"

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.810
Hey, just a minute here!
This is my rental!?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.890
How come my sports car rental
is a light truck!?

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.640
This is really lame.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.270
You again!?

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.940
Mawiko 'is wanking for Sana-chan.
Mister, have you seen her?

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:34.190
What's this, you're one
of Sana-chan's fans?

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.530
No way, no way, Sana-chan is too busy.
Go on home to your mothuh.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:39.530
Mawiko isn't going home
until she sees Sana-chan!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.200
Hey, let go of me! I'm going home now!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.870
No! No! No!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.210
What's that!?

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.050
All of you, bow your heads!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.210
Whom dost thou take
this gentleman to be!? He is Mito--

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.880
Excuse me!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.550
--Have you seen Mariko-chan?
--She's a cute little girl.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.890
I have not seen such a maiden.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:00.890
Do you know where Mariko-chan is?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.220
She hath not come hither.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.220
--She's a cute three-year-old!
--She's a cute three-year-old girl!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:05.230
I know not of her.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:09.560
All right then, please call out one
last time to your missing husband, okay?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.820
Right. Dear, please come back!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.900
You don't have to eat
those green peppers that you hate.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.240
You can also watch your
three anime shows every day, dear...

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.240
Mariko-chan!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.240
Mariko!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.240
Dear!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.240
Mariko-chan!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:22.910
Mariko!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.240
Dear!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.910
The autumnal rain front from the west
will start to clear out tonight,

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.250
and tomorrow, the whole country
will be clear, followed by--

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.880
--occasional missing little girls!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.550
Um, could you circle around
to the left next, please?

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.010
Why?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:40.890
Say, Mariko-chan,
I'm gonna take you home, okay?

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:44.220
No! Mawiko is not going home
until she sees Sana-chan!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.520
Still insisting on that, are you?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.560
In any case, for the time being,
come home with Uncle to my house.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.560
Once there, we can contact--

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.230
N- now what!?

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.570
Potty!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.900
Now you're telling me, here?
Can't you hold it in a little lawnguh?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:58.900
It's coming out, coming out!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.240
What!?

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.620
Wait, Mariko-chan!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.580
Are you all right, Sana-chan?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.710
After searching this much
and not finding her,

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.920
I wonder if she isn't here
in the TV station.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.590
She's an incredibly cute
little three-year-old.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.260
She's got the exact
same mouth that I have.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.930
I'd like to help, but I'm just a tree.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.930
Even though you're a tree,
you haven't seen her?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:26.930
Ah, Indian Panda-san,
about this lovely three-year-old girl...

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.600
Her favorite food is bananas,

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:30.390
--and she has a small cavity
in her back tooth.
--Mariko...

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.850
--We were careful about that, too...
--Mariko is our reason for living.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:36.860
My husband is usually a quiet man,
who doesn't say much,

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.860
but when it comes to Mariko, it's almost
as if he becomes a different person.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.200
Her name is Mariko. Are you
sure you haven't seen her?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.820
--Please tell me you've seen her!
--Even when we first met,

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:47.540
--She is an adorable little girl. Well?
--just having him by my side in silence
made me feel very much at peace.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:51.250
Even knowing about me... even knowing
about me and you, Sana-chan,

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:55.250
he still loves us every bit.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.210
It sounds like you're very happy.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.220
I'm sorry.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.840
Why are you apologizing?
You have to be happy!

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:05.550
You're alive and well,
so you have to be happy!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.890
Right...

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.180
Sana-chan! I've got some information!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.560
A friend of mine says he found someone
who looks like Mariko-chan!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.560
Really, Rei-kun!?

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.900
He's following her now!

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.900
Yay! You've outdone yourself, Rei-kun!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.230
Nah... Ah, it's been so long...!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.400
"Zenjiro-chan's Private Room"

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:22.400
And now, the first public
showing of our star's home.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:30.910
She looks like an angel
when she's asleep.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.210
What's this, some kind of trouble?

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.540
Awl right, awlready!
What a nuisance! Who is it!?

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:39.840
Mariko-chan!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.220
--Mariko!
--Mariko-chan!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.890
Ah! Sana-chan! Papa! Mama!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.180
Mariko...

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.220
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:50.560
Mama...

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:55.350
W- what the hell is happening here?

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.900
What's going on?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.910
Uh, sawrry, but what have I done?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:10.240
Aw, today has been a total disaster
for Zenjiro-chan.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.250
So then, when Zenjiro-sensei
told us what happened afterward,

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.250
boy were we surprised!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.210
Mariko-chan's papa
turned white as a sheet!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.880
Papa bowed over and over.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.550
Right. He bowed his head right to
the floor apologizing to Zenjiro-san.

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.590
Aw, we couldn't decipher
the Burutcha code the whole time,

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.220
and didn't help out at all.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:29.600
After all, the code that Akito-kun
deciphered doesn't make any sense.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:33.930
"Mariko-crunch trouble,
whereabouts insomnia.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:34.940
Please look strong often miso."

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.230
Akito-kun, you're not very good
at reading codes, huh?

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.270
But then, everyone has their faults.

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:43.570
All right! All's well that ends well,
so I'm going to compose a song!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.610
Yeah!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.950
You're going to sing?

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.620
Rhythm: an easygoing waltz.

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.160
♪ Do-re-do-mi-do-re-so...! ♪

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:51.790
Lights on!

00:21:54.450 --> 00:21:59.460
♪ I really love you! ♪

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:06.420
♪ Let's dance together! ♪

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.140
Isn't that nice and carefree?

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:18.140
You're sure being carefree is okay?

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:19.810
Hayama, won't you dance with us?

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:21.820
You're sure?

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:34.410
What kind of vibe is this?
Who on earth is this person?

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:38.960
I'm scared! Wait until next time!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.210
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.720
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.470
In dire straits,

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.940
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.030
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:11.070
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.670
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.180
...for two.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.640
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.690
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.280
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.950
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.460
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:12.470
Whoa! Kurata Sana's greatest weakness
has been discovered!

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:15.800
1 + 1 is 2, but 3 + 2 is...
just a minute...

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:17.470
I'm slower than everyone
when it comes to doing math.

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.390
At this rate, I'll never get
into middle school!

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:21.140
I'll be a 6th grader the rest of my life!

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:26.150
Next time, on "Kodomo no Omocha,"
episode 24, the Please Listen to My Sad
Story Saga, the Slapstick Version Saga,

00:24:26.480 --> 00:24:30.490
Math Life Drives Me Batty

00:24:30.490 --> 00:24:34.530
Oh, there's a leftover make-out picture!?
Sounds like fun!
